WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:06.200
NASA's Psyche spacecraft tests out its solar arrays

00:09.900 --> 00:16.600
Tests at NASA's Jet Propulsion Laboratory show how Psyche is preparing for its solar-powered journey

00:33.700 --> 00:38.700
Twin solar arrays will power the 1.5 billion-mile trip to the asteroid Psyche

00:41.200 --> 00:46.100
Each array will open up in under 8 minutes, about an hour after launch

00:48.700 --> 00:53.700
The solar arrays are the largest ever installed at JPL

00:56.600 --> 01:03.600
37 feet (11.3 meters). Engineers had to unfold one array at a time
